Package: cbamm
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Bayesian and Advanced Meta-Analysis Methods
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Mahmood", "Ahmad", email = "mahmood.ahmad2@nhs.net",
                        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for meta-analysis including traditional methods
    (DerSimonian-Laird, REML), advanced techniques (network meta-analysis, Bayesian,
    multivariate, IPD, dose-response), machine learning approaches (random forest,
    neural networks), living systematic reviews, publication-quality visualizations,
    and seamless integration with other meta-analysis packages. Designed for both
    simple and complex meta-analytic needs with performance optimization and
    parallel processing capabilities.
